  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "# Minimal LibraryLink OPE Checks\n\nExpected input interpretations:\n- `bc` means `OPE[R[b[0,z]], R[c[0,w]]]`\n- `cbc` means `OPE[R[c[0,z]], R[b[0,w], c[0,w]]]`\n\nRun cells top-to-bottom.",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {},
   "executionSummary": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "root = \"/home/scheinpflug/LeanExperiment\";\nlibPath = FileNameJoin[{root, \"libLeanOPELink.so\"}];\nlibLoadPath = FileNameJoin[{$TemporaryDirectory, \"libLeanOPELink-\" <> IntegerString[Hash[AbsoluteTime[]]] <> \".so\"}];\nCopyFile[libPath, libLoadPath, OverwriteTarget -> True];\nleanOPECase = LibraryFunctionLoad[libLoadPath, \"leanOPECaseLL\", {\"UTF8String\"}, \"UTF8String\"];\n\"loaded\"",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {},
   "executionSummary": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "leanOPECase[\"bc\"]",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {},
   "executionSummary": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "leanOPECase[\"cbc\"]",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {},
   "executionSummary": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "## Benchmark n = 1..8 (LibraryLink)\n\nRuns the same benchmark input family through LibraryLink (no RunProcess).",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {},
   "executionSummary": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "leanOPEBenchN = LibraryFunctionLoad[libLoadPath, \"leanOPEBenchNLL\", {\"UTF8String\"}, \"UTF8String\"];\n\"bench-loaded\"",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {},
   "executionSummary": {}
  },
